  (title_block
    (title "Modular outdoor monitor A (USB + M8)")
    (date "2026-11-27")
    (rev "D")
    (company "DIY modular outdoor monitor")
    (comment 1 "Not the AirGradient V1.3 PCB. Modules plus an M8 A-coded 4-pin panel plug.")
    (comment 2 "USB jack, or M8 pins 1 and 3, feed the dev-board 5V pin. 3V3 pin feeds the I2C modules.")
    (comment 3 "M8: 1 brown +5V, 2 white VBAT, 3 blue GND, 4 black VSOL. Sense only on pins 2 and 4.")
    (comment 4 "D1 1N5822 ORs M8 5V onto the 5V pin. F1 PTC and D2 TVS protect that input.")
    (comment 5 "A4 landscape 297 x 210 mm. Rev D, 2026-11-27.")
  )

