  (label "USBDET" (at 266.7 86.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left))
    (uuid a3dc4e4e-7952-40c8-b096-c91a34e880ee)
  )
  (text "Power: dev-board USB, or J1 M8 pins 1 and 3 when USB is unplugged. Never feed the 3V3 pin." (at 8.89 6.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid e0e199e1-a2db-4e98-a692-43c0ab4eb35e)
  )
  (text "M8 pin 1: F1 MF-R110, D2 P6KE6.8A, D1 1N5822 (anode at M8) into the dev-board 5V pin = +5V_SPS = SPS30 VDD." (at 8.89 8.89 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 42d18ad6-b070-433a-aaa0-3c01558fbf66)
  )
  (text "M8 pin 2 VBAT 2.7-4.6 V: D3 P6KE6.8A, R10/R11 1.00M/1.00M, C10 100n. ADC = VBAT/2 (4.6 V -> 2.30 V, 6.2 V -> 3.10 V)." (at 8.89 11.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2a95b96a-0503-4dd5-a539-0770575dce16)
  )
  (text "M8 pin 4 VSOL up to 22 V: D4 P6KE30A, R12/R13 1.80M/200k, C11 100n. ADC = VSOL/10 (22 V -> 2.20 V, 25 V -> 2.50 V, 31 V -> 3.10 V)." (at 8.89 13.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid cb9dd8b0-fe58-4628-8f66-08505f9bbf8b)
  )
  (text "J2 is the micro-USB VBUS pad, before the LOLIN32 CJ2301 or the D1 mini Schottky. Not the 5V header." (at 8.89 16.51 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a3feb8ae-bba9-4e38-b9a7-dfc31219288c)
  )
  (text "Firmware reads A_VBAT and A_VSOL, and reports both as 0 while USBDET is above 1.2 V." (at 8.89 19.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 7baf3f44-4f1d-4af4-b00c-f2d05d3d9723)
  )
  (text "LOLIN32 and D1 mini: 5V pin after D1, 3V3 pin is the onboard LDO. Do not back-feed 3V3." (at 8.89 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid ed18ecc7-2f99-4376-bbbd-8d76d01e9e87)
  )
  (text "SDA GPIO21, SCL GPIO22. VBAT GPIO34, VSOL GPIO35, USB detect GPIO32. PH-2 socket stays empty." (at 8.89 24.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid db050114-145a-4013-863d-6d60f607acd8)
  )
  (text "I2C is 100 kHz at 3.3 V. R1 and R2 are 4.7k to +3V3. Fit U4 or U5, not both. U6 SEL to GND before power-up." (at 8.89 26.67 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid ac914804-1e68-4cb1-93a1-ecd77fead24c)
  )
  (text "Leave open: GPIO0/2/12/15 (strap), GPIO5 (LED), GPIO1/3/4, GPIO16/17 (Serial2), GPIO6-11 (flash)." (at 8.89 29.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 1ab24329-5f75-4aa0-a1bc-323b15c90903)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
